# dgraph-use-local-badger.patch: build Dgraph against the patched Badger beside it (engines/dgraph/badger). Found missing at the 2026-10-26 patch check: the old repo carried this go.mod line in its tracked tree, and dgraph-profile.patch needs it.
diff --git dgraph/dgraph-25.0.0/go.mod dgraph/dgraph-25.0.0/go.mod
--- dgraph/dgraph-25.0.0/go.mod
+++ dgraph/dgraph-25.0.0/go.mod
@@ -179,3 +179,6 @@
 	gopkg.in/yaml.v2 v2.4.0 // indirect
 	gotest.tools/v3 v3.5.2 // indirect
 )
+
+// Use local BadgerDB for development
+replace github.com/dgraph-io/badger/v4 => ../badger
\ No newline at end of file
